    "evidence": "Strong, cohesive dark technical aesthetic with disciplined cyan/red/yellow semantics, crisp cards, and clear ROI emphasis across viewports. However, desktop composition is top-heavy with excessive empty space and awkward headline wrapping; tablet/mobile become very long and visually repetitive. Small mono labels and muted body text are difficult to read, especially on mobile. The header feels crowded and truncated at tablet/mobile sizes, with reduced brand presence and partially visible navigation.",
